aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.main_hub.speaker=Lyra Fairhollow
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.main_hub.fallback=Good to see you. The guild hall keeps the town safer when adventurers can sign on properly.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.main_hub.greeting.0=Hello. Need a guard, or just passing through?
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.main_hub.greeting.1=Lyren sends his regards when he remembers. What can I do for you?
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.main_hub.greeting.2=The hall is quiet until we finish building it. Then the roster fills at dawn.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.main_hub.c_guild_hall=About the guild hall
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.main_hub.c_guild_hall_finish=The guild hall is ready
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.main_hub.c_guild_building=How is the guild hall coming along?
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.main_hub.c_house=You wanted to talk about a house.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.main_hub.c_house_finish=Your name is on the house shelf. I figured you should hear it.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.main_hub.c_house_remind=The house is still coming together.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.main_hub.leave=Goodbye
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.guild_hall_offer.speaker=Lyra Fairhollow
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.guild_hall_offer.body=Lyren asked me to keep an eye on the town, but I would rather give adventurers a proper hall. Stake a plot, gather the materials, and we can hire guards from the roster each morning.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.guild_hall_offer.accept=I will build the guild hall
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.guild_hall_offer.decline=Not yet
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.guild_hall_accepted.speaker=Lyra Fairhollow
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.guild_hall_accepted.body=Take the plot token and raise the hall. I will move in once the sign reads complete.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.guild_hall_accepted.ok=Understood
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.guild_hall_building.speaker=Lyra Fairhollow
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.guild_hall_building.body=Keep at it. When the hall stands, adventurers will appear at dawn for hire.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.guild_hall_building.ok=I am on it
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.guild_hall_done.speaker=Lyra Fairhollow
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.guild_hall_done.body=There it is. Adventurers will sign on at dawn, and you can hire guards who know how to hold a line.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.guild_hall_done.ok=Good to hear
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.lyra_house_offer.speaker=Lyra Fairhollow
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.lyra_house_offer.body=The hall is for work and guards. I still want a small home like everyone else. Build it, put my name on the shelf when it stands, and come find me.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.lyra_house_offer.accept=I will get it built.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.lyra_house_offer.decline=Another time.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.lyra_house_accepted.speaker=Lyra Fairhollow
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.lyra_house_accepted.body=Good. When the walls are up, list me on the shelf inside, then come tell me so we can call it settled.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.lyra_house_accepted.ok=Count on it.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.lyra_house_remind.speaker=Lyra Fairhollow
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.lyra_house_remind.body=Take your time. When the house is done, put my name on the shelf and come find me.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.lyra_house_remind.ok=I will let you know.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.lyra_house_finish.speaker=Lyra Fairhollow
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.lyra_house_finish.body=There. A door that is mine at night. That is worth more than it looks.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_guild_master.lyra_house_finish.ok=You earned it.
